                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "28773780-e95e-3323-9be3-2962d5e73dae",
                        "entry_id": "cdce897b-1579-38c1-83a3-929788a0325d",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Someone who lives in the suburbs."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "informal"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "93dc60b6-c3f2-4d61-9eb7-c96c950af84f",
                                "sense_id": "28773780-e95e-3323-9be3-2962d5e73dae",
                                "text": "Don't call me a suburbanite just because I live in Oak Grove!"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "c7aea8ba-f9ec-45b3-8b25-5c9d38a6df00",
                                "sense_id": "28773780-e95e-3323-9be3-2962d5e73dae",
                                "text": "I would suggest that we give the Brooklyn Rapid Transit Company a chance to correct the existing faults before condemning the scheme. A SUBURBANITE."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "d38e3439-3b59-4f75-9e89-7d6ff869b23c",
                                "sense_id": "28773780-e95e-3323-9be3-2962d5e73dae",
                                "text": "The line was doubled in the nineties and Hillfoot station added for suburbanites in 1900."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "5c37f0fd-2d32-4df0-acb4-b7fcec731a78",
                                "sense_id": "28773780-e95e-3323-9be3-2962d5e73dae",
                                "text": "Today’s affluent suburbanites might resent the suggestion that they’re guilty of racial animus, but they’re entirely comfortable with being accused of colorblind class prejudice."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "a0006d17-650c-4324-96d8-c2bf195cebfa",
                                "sense_id": "28773780-e95e-3323-9be3-2962d5e73dae",
                                "text": "Then there’s the problem of charging EVs. Suburbanites with home garages can install chargers, but the lack of public chargers on city streets hasn’t become a major issue yet only because so few people own EVs."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
